  "question": "For every available historical NBA date, what is its EXACT leakage-safe research eligibility? A date is FULLY_RESEARCH_ELIGIBLE only when its PREGAME state is provable (capturedAt < tip-off for every used input), not merely because a final board + result exist.",
  "eligibilityRule": "boardGeneratedAt < tipoffTime AND (newsCapturedAt==null OR newsCapturedAt<tipoffTime) AND every sourceGameDate < slateDate, with tipoffTime a PROVEN ISO instant. Enforced by app/src/lib/nba/feature-timing-contract.ts + pregame-snapshot-contract.ts.",
  "categoriesLegend": {
    "FULLY_RESEARCH_ELIGIBLE": "market + trailing features present AND a proven ISO tip-off so capturedAt<tipoff holds for every used input + decisive settlement",
    "TIMESTAMP_UNPROVEN": "market + trailing features present, but tip-off is stored display-only ('8:30 PM ET') so pregame timing cannot be mechanically proven \u2014 the ONLY blocker to full eligibility",
    "MARKET_ONLY": "market lines present but no usable trailing features",
    "FEATURES_ONLY": "trailing features present but no market lines",
    "RESULT_ONLY": "settled outcomes exist but the pregame board/odds/features are missing or unreconstructable",
    "UNUSABLE": "empty scaffold \u2014 nothing usable (no leans, odds, features, or result)"
  },
